@startuml
title 三个方案的鉴权架构对比

package "方案1：gateway 承接（正式理想）" {
  [gateway\nOAuth 授权服务器] as g1auth
  [ops /mcp\nResource Server] as g1mcp
  g1auth ..> g1mcp : 校验 access_token
}

package "方案2：ops 内嵌（本期临时）" {
  [ops\nOAuth 授权服务器] as g2auth
  [ops /mcp\nResource Server] as g2mcp
  g2auth ..> g2mcp : 校验 access_token
}

package "方案3：不鉴权（仅 beta 联调）" {
  [ops /mcp\n无鉴权] as g3mcp
}

actor "客户 agent" as c1
actor "客户 agent" as c2
actor "客户 agent" as c3

c1 --> g1auth : 授权码流
c1 --> g1mcp : 调用工具
c2 --> g2auth : 授权码流
c2 --> g2mcp : 调用工具
c3 --> g3mcp : 直接调用(任意人)

note bottom of g1auth
跨团队仓，排期不受控
end note
note bottom of g2auth
本团队可控，安全面扩大需内网隔离
end note
note bottom of g3mcp
正式禁用：无身份、无行级权限、越权风险
end note
@enduml
